      "story_intro": "常青之春的暖巢还没焐热，远方山谷传来消息：那里的荆棘守灵睡过了整个春天，梦里尽是上季魔王的回声，醒来时把第一条山道当成了入侵者的通道。春雷滚过双径——想借路，先赢过睡眼惺忪的它。",
      "story_intro_en": "The Everlasting Spring's nest was barely warm when word came from the valley afar: its bramble warden had slept through the whole spring, dreaming nothing but echoes of last season's demon lords, and on waking took the first lane for an invader's road. Spring thunder rolled down both lanes — borrow the path, or first beat the drowsy warden at its own gate.",
      "story_outro": "守灵打着哈欠认了输，把山道的刺门一瓣瓣收好。它睡眼朦胧地指路：再往深处，霜镜还立在第二条岔口等着照心。",
      "story_outro_en": "Yawning in defeat, the warden folded its thorn-gate petal by petal. Bleary-eyed, it pointed the way onward: deeper in, the frost mirror still waits at the second fork to read your heart."
    },
