      "story_intro": "未醒山谷的入口竖着一面霜镜，把来路照成三条：镜灵说，心诚者何惧分身。荆棘镇把泉庭的旧阵型交给艾吉——三径同守，一如三王压境的那一夜。",
      "story_intro_en": "At the mouth of the un-woken valley stood a frost mirror, splitting every traveller's road into three. The mirror spirits said: a true heart fears no reflections. Bramble Town handed Eggy the old garden formation — hold three roads at once, as on the night three kings marched in.",
      "story_outro": "三面霜镜同时映出同一颗蛋。镜灵收起寒气，让开中路：雾的那一头，钟声已经开始犹豫要不要响。",
      "story_outro_en": "Three frost mirrors reflected one and the same egg. The spirits withdrew their chill and opened the middle road: beyond the mist, a bell was hesitating whether to ring."
