      ],
      "story_intro": "雾谷的钟百年不响，响则换季。守钟人说钟舌被上季残雾冻住了，唯有让村子的塔在双径上打赢一场体面的仗，热气才够化开它。于是艾吉把泉庭的火种塔全数搬进了雾里。",
      "story_intro_en": "The mistglen bell had not rung in a hundred years; when it rings, a season turns. The bellkeeper said its tongue was frozen by last season's leftover mist — only a decent fight won by the village towers on both lanes could warm it enough. So Eggy carried every ember turret of the spring yard into the fog.",
      "story_outro": "钟声穿过雾谷，把两条山道上的残雾一齐震成细雨。守钟人赠下一程风向：风车镇的守灵，最不服春天。",
      "story_outro_en": "The bell cut across the glen and beat the lingering mist on both lanes into fine rain. The bellkeeper passed on the next wind: the warden of Windmill Town trusts spring the least of all."
    },
