      "story_intro": "风车镇的守灵没睡——它根本不信冬天已输：风刃昼夜不歇，飞兵沿着两条长廓反复试探塔阵的空隙。守灵放话：让蛋在风里亮一夜，天亮它自认输。艾吉把对空的枪位排进了风声里。",
      "story_intro_en": "Windmill Town's warden never slept — it refused to believe winter had lost: windblades toiled day and night, and flyers probed the gaps of the turret line along two long galleries. Let the egg stand one night in the wind, the warden declared, and by dawn it concedes. Eggy lined the anti-air perches into the gale itself.",
      "story_outro": "风在黎明前先眨了眼。守灵把风车叶片转成致意的方向——只有最后一条路还黑着：长夜的本殿，就在泉庭的正下方。",
      "story_outro_en": "Before dawn, the wind blinked first. The warden turned its mill blades into a salute — only the last road lay dark: the great hall of the long night, directly beneath the spring yard."
    },
