      ],
      "story_intro": "钟声、雷声与风声在泉庭底下汇成同一个影子——长夜守灵，四季里唯一没被春天唤醒也拒绝被唤醒的那一位。它遣出三镇之影，各踏一径，重演上季三王的阵势：既然你们的春天不信有冬，那就让长夜亲自答辩。",
      "story_intro_en": "Bell, thunder and wind pooled into one shadow beneath the spring yard — the warden of the long night, the only one of the four seasons neither woken by spring nor willing to wake. It sent out the shades of three towns, each treading one road, restaging last season's three kings: if your spring refuses to believe in winter, then let the long night plead its case itself.",
      "story_outro": "长夜在破晓时松了手。它没有输——它只是把剩下的黑，收进了夏夜乘凉的蝉声里。庭院的泉往深处又涌了一程：听说夏天的海岸，正有事要发生。",
      "story_outro_en": "The long night let go at daybreak. It did not lose — it merely folded the rest of its dark into cicadas for summer evenings to enjoy. Deep under the yard, the spring surged one stage further: word is, something is about to happen on the summer shore."
